---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Supplements: Creatine, Omega-3, Protein & More — Nawtch"
  description="Evidence-based guides for supplements — creatine, omega-3, protein, vitamin D, caffeine, berberine & more — with real citations and honest dosing."
  canonicalPath="/supplements/"
  bodyClass="diets"
>
  <header>
    <div class="header-left">
      <h1>Supplements, Honestly Reviewed</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Popular supplements, one page each — real citations, realistic dosing, and no "must-haves."</p>
    </div>
    <a class="ghost-btn" style="font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;" href="#" onclick="window.history.back(); return false;">← Back</a>
  </header>

  <p class="field-hint" style="margin:-4px 0 14px;">
    Educational only, not medical advice! None of these are presented as
    essential. Some have strong research behind them, others much thinner. Our <a href="/diets/">Diets</a> and <a href="/calculators/">Calculators</a> pages can help you figure out your goals before trying anything.
  </p>

  <div class="items-section">
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/creatine/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">bolt</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Creatine</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">The most well-studied ergogenic supplement there is — for strength, lean mass, and increasingly for older adults' brains too.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/omega-3/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">set_meal</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Omega-3 / Fish Oil</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">EPA and DHA for heart and brain health, with a real evidence gap between fatty fish and fish oil pills.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/electrolytes/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">water_drop</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Electrolytes</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Genuinely useful for heavy sweating and endurance work, unnecessary for most everyday workouts.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/protein/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">fitness_center</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Protein / Whey</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">A convenient way to hit a daily protein target — the total matters far more than any single shake's timing.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/vitamin-d/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">wb_sunny</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Vitamin D</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Correcting a genuinely common deficiency, with much weaker evidence once your levels are already normal.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/magnesium/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">bedtime</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Magnesium</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Well-established for correcting deficiency, with an early and still-thin case for the sleep benefits it's now sold on.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/caffeine/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">local_cafe</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Caffeine</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">The world's most-used performance aid, with real daily limits and a sleep cost if timed too late.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/collagen/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">healing</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Collagen</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Modest, real evidence for joint comfort in active adults — thinner evidence behind the skin claims it's often sold on.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/beta-alanine/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">vibration</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Beta-Alanine</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Helps with short, high-intensity efforts, and comes with a harmless tingling side effect most people notice.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/berberine/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">eco</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Berberine</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Real blood sugar and lipid effects, but a drug interaction profile that deserves more caution than anything else here.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/ashwagandha/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">spa</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Ashwagandha</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Real trial evidence for stress and cortisol, alongside documented — if uncommon — liver and thyroid risks.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/nad-nmn/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">science</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">NAD+ / NMN</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">A biomarker that reliably rises, and a functional benefit in humans that's still unproven.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/fiber/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">grass</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Fiber</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">One of the biggest, most consistent nutrient gaps around — with real cardiovascular and metabolic evidence behind closing it.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/prebiotics-probiotics/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">bubble_chart</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Prebiotics &amp; Probiotics</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Feeding your existing gut bacteria versus adding new strains — evidence that's solid for some strains and thin for others.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/supplements/peptides/" style="border-color:var(--warn); background:rgba(240,96,96,0.06);">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon" style="color:var(--warn);">warning</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Peptides</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">A separate category with real regulatory and safety differences — read before exploring.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
